Bind Npc 16079 Zone 21
Quest 91 "Trade with Menissiah"
    Journal "You decided to trade with Menissiah."
    Collect 5 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 17

Rewards
    Give 3 of 379229000

direction_5 = location "[Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah" about "[Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah\nCheerful girl who likes to help others; interested in production and medicine" found "Moradon central stepfront" at 797 543 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, if you need <font color=@#006666@>Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll</font>, look for Menissiah."
    Topic "Where is he/she?" do
        Map direction_5

On offer
    Say "Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll? Did I have that?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Say "Ah, here it is! This what you wanted? I haven't used it for a while so it slipped my mind. You need it?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Make you a deal. I need Apples of Moradon for reasons of my own, see, but I have no clue how to find it. Suppose you get me 5 Apples of Moradon and I'll give YOU this Magic Scroll.\n\nNothing free in this world. Or can't you handle it?"

On in_progress
    Say "Still don't have it? Putting me on the spot here..."

On ready
    Say "Master, all 5 Apples of Moradon have been gathered!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Look at that, got it right away. You're better than I thought."
